&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;A reconciliation of OGT's provision for income taxes calculated at the federal statutory rate to the actual income tax provision recorded for the years ended December 31, 2025, and 2024 is as follows:&lt;/p&gt;

